<title>UK: GOLF-WOMEN'S BRITISH OPEN FIRST ROUND SCORES.</title>
<headline>GOLF-WOMEN'S BRITISH OPEN FIRST ROUND SCORES.</headline>
<dateline>SUNNINGDALE, England 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading scores from</p>
<p>the first round of the women's British Open on Thursday:</p>
<p>65 Karrie Webb (Australia)</p>
<p>68 Liselotte Neumann (Sweden), Trish Johnson (Britain)</p>
<p>69 Helen Alfredsson (Sweden), Juli Inkster (U.S.),</p>
<p>Emilee Klein (U.S.)</p>
<p>70 Loraine Lambert (Australia), Fumiko Muraguchi</p>
<p>(Japan), Rosie Jones (U.S.), Catriona Matthew</p>
<p>(Britain), Kathryn Marshall (Britain), Silvia</p>
<p>Cavalleri (Italy), Tina Barrett (U.S.), Amy</p>
<p>Alcott (U.S.), Cindy Schreyer (U.S.), Lori Kane</p>
<p>(Canada).</p>
</text>
